  first | exact @GlobalTheory.BSP.RhoZeroNormBounds.seed_norms | exact GlobalTheory.BSP.RhoZeroNormBounds.seed_norms | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.BSP.RhoZeroNormBounds.seed_norms <;> assumption)
